# nvidia-cuda-amd64.pkgs -- seeds for the OPTIONAL NVIDIA driver + CUDA 13.4
# toolkit closure folded into the AMD64 offline mirror.
#
# Consumed by build/build-desktop-mirror.sh and build/build-forky-mirror.sh
# (and checked by build/verify-*-mirror-seeds.sh) ONLY for amd64, and only
# when NCZ_INCLUDE_CUDA is not 0. It is deliberately NOT part of
# desktop-amd64.pkgs: the mkosi role delta installs that manifest into every
# image, whereas these packages are installed at real install time by
# post-install/54-gpu-accel.sh, and only when a Turing-or-newer NVIDIA GPU is
# present. They come from NVIDIA's own signed Debian 13 repo
# (developer.download.nvidia.com/compute/cuda/repos/debian13/x86_64/), wired
# by the staged cuda-keyring package; assets/nvidia/ncz-nvidia-cuda.pref keeps
# the driver on the R615 branch.
#
# Measured 2026-09-29 on PEGASUS (forky, RTX 2060; real install, apt reported
# "Need to get 1,393 MB ... 2,742 MB of additional disk space"):
#   cuda-compiler-13-4 + cuda-cudart-dev-13-4 + cuda-libraries-13-4
#   = 32 packages, 1.39 GB download, 2.74 GB installed (13.4.2-1 metapackages).
# Mirror closure added on top of the amd64 desktop seed (resolved against the
# forky snapshot + NVIDIA repo, no existing package changes version): +130
# packages -- 32 CUDA (1.33 GB), 53 driver stack (0.33 GB), 45 Debian-side
# (gcc-16/g++-16/binutils/libc6-dev/make/dpkg-dev pulled by the build-essential
# dependency of cuda-nvcc; forky gcc 16.2 is a supported nvcc host compiler).
# The full cuda-toolkit-13-4 metapackage (Nsight Compute 1.5 GB installed,
# docs, math-library headers) is ~2.0 GB download / ~4.2 GB installed larger
# and is NOT shipped; `apt install cuda-toolkit-13-4` remains available live.

# --- driver (R615, open kernel modules, Turing+ only) -----------------------
nvidia-detect   # solo: Conflicts nvidia-kernel-support; resolved on its own
cuda-drivers
libnvidia-encode1
libnvcuvid1

# --- CUDA 13.4 toolkit, slim developer set ----------------------------------
cuda-compiler-13-4
cuda-cudart-dev-13-4
cuda-libraries-13-4
